       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001):\n\n- **Drug:** metformin 1700 mg by mouth, three times daily with meals (5,100 mg/day)\n- **Note on the order:** the total daily dose is above the labeled maximum, and you confirmed it was intended. The note also asks pharmacy to verify it.\n\nPharmacy may still contact you about the dose. I'd also watch GI tolerance, and lactate if the patient develops symptoms. If you decide to change the dose, tell me and I'll enter the revised order."
